  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You touch a willing creature. Until the spell ends, the target’s skin has a rough, bark-like appearance, and the target’s AC can’t be less than 16, regardless of what kind of armor it is wearing.</p><p><strong>At Higher Levels.</strong> When you use this creation using a creation slot of 4th level, the AC can't be less than 17. It can't be less than 18 at 6th level. It can't be less than 19 at 8th level.</p>",
